        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 What is Ollsgar’d?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💜 Ollsgar’d is a bold and hilarious reimagining of the classic marbles game, now turned into a wild, challenging, voice‑controlled experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎤 HOW IT WORKS?<br>📢 Speak, sing, shout, or make any sound to launch your marble and score!<br>🎸 Instruments, claps, your dog barking, grandma’s laughter… any sound can be your controller.<br>If it makes noise, you can play!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 MARBLE BATTLE MODE<br>💥 Face up to 999 rounds of pure challenge, noise, and vocal strategy.<br>💣 The Arena is way too small for all that craziness: balance is everything!<br>🌈 Aim for the legendary Round 999+ to earn the title of Marble Master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💡 Simple to learn. Impossible to forget.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full voice-and-sound control</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic, funny gameplay modes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique style with humor, challenge, and sound creativity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for laughing with friends (or screaming solo 😂)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💜 Get ready for the craziest game your throat has ever faced!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694660/extras/0148d77e79baf12978c7a3a6ad90ed20.poster.avif?t=1767052759\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694660/extras/0148d77e79baf12978c7a3a6ad90ed20.webm?t=1767052759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694660/extras/0148d77e79baf12978c7a3a6ad90ed20.mp4?t=1767052759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 What is Ollsgar’d?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💜 Ollsgar’d is a bold and hilarious reimagining of the classic marbles game, now turned into a wild, challenging, voice‑controlled experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎤 HOW IT WORKS?<br>📢 Speak, sing, shout, or make any sound to launch your marble and score!<br>🎸 Instruments, claps, your dog barking, grandma’s laughter… any sound can be your controller.<br>If it makes noise, you can play!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 MARBLE BATTLE MODE<br>💥 Face up to 999 rounds of pure challenge, noise, and vocal strategy.<br>💣 The Arena is way too small for all that craziness: balance is everything!<br>🌈 Aim for the legendary Round 999+ to earn the title of Marble Master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💡 Simple to learn. Impossible to forget.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full voice-and-sound control</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic, funny gameplay modes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique style with humor, challenge, and sound creativity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for laughing with friends (or screaming solo 😂)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💜 Get ready for the craziest game your throat has ever faced!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694660/extras/0148d77e79baf12978c7a3a6ad90ed20.poster.avif?t=1767052759\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694660/extras/0148d77e79baf12978c7a3a6ad90ed20.webm?t=1767052759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694660/extras/0148d77e79baf12978c7a3a6ad90ed20.mp4?t=1767052759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
